{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-39521","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-44986","text":"FleetPrompt — Implementation Build Prompt"}]},{"id":"blk-39522","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-44987","marks":["bold"],"text":"Version:"},{"id":"spn-44988","text":" 1.0 | "},{"id":"spn-44989","marks":["bold"],"text":"Date:"},{"id":"spn-44990","text":" April 2026 | "},{"id":"spn-44991","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type:"},{"id":"spn-44992","text":" Full Implementation (Phoenix + OTP + Supabase)"}]},{"id":"blk-39523","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-44993","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-39524","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-44994","text":"Your Mission"}]},{"id":"blk-39525","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-44995","text":"You are building "},{"id":"spn-44996","marks":["bold"],"text":"FleetPrompt"},{"id":"spn-44997","text":" — the open agent marketplace for the [&] Protocol ecosystem. FleetPrompt is the registry where production-ready AI agents are published, discovered, and deployed in one click. Every listed agent carries a versioned manifest, a computed trust score, declared permissions, and a linked SpecPrompt spec."}]},{"id":"blk-39526","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-44998","marks":["bold"],"text":"Read `docs/spec/README.md` fully before writing a single line."},{"id":"spn-44999","text":" It is the authoritative spec."}]},{"id":"blk-39527","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45000","text":"FleetPrompt is the "},{"id":"spn-45001","marks":["bold"],"text":"distribution layer"},{"id":"spn-45002","text":" of the dark factory pipeline:"}]},{"id":"blk-39528","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SpecPrompt (spec in) → Agentelic (build) → OS-008 (enforce) → FleetPrompt (distribute) → RuneFort (observe)"},{"id":"blk-39529","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45003","text":"FleetPrompt is also the "},{"id":"spn-45004","marks":["bold"],"text":"canonical trust broker"},{"id":"spn-45005","text":" of the [&] ecosystem — it aggregates PRISM CL scores, test coverage, usage data, and audit quality into a single trust score."}]},{"id":"blk-39530","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45006","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-39531","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-45007","text":"Target Stack"}]},{"id":"blk-39532","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Language:     Elixir 1.17+ / OTP 27\nFramework:    Phoenix 1.8+ (LiveView for real-time search, PubSub for trust broadcasts)\nDatabase:     PostgreSQL via shared Supabase (fleet.* schema, migration range 030-039)\nSearch:       pg_trgm + ts_vector (no external search infra)\nHot Cache:    ETS (:fp_manifests, :fp_trust_scores, :fp_search_index, :fp_categories)\nAudit:        Broadway pipeline (batched, append-only)\nBackground:   Oban (trust recompute, webhook delivery, search index refresh)\nAuth:         Supabase Auth (shared [&] ecosystem — amp.profiles, amp.workspaces)\nTelemetry:    :telemetry + Prometheus\nDeploy:       Mix release + Docker on Fly.io"},{"id":"blk-39533","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45008","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-39534","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-45009","text":"Repository Structure"}]},{"id":"blk-39535","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45010","text":"Create this structure inside "},{"id":"spn-45011","marks":["code"],"text":"fleetprompt.com/"},{"id":"spn-45012","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-39536","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"fleetprompt.com/\n├── lib/\n│   ├── fleet_prompt/\n│   │   ├── agents/\n│   │   │   └── agent.ex               # FleetPrompt.Agents.Agent schema (fleet.agents)\n│   │   ├── manifests/\n│   │   │   └── manifest.ex            # FleetPrompt.Manifests.Manifest schema (fleet.manifests)\n│   │   ├── publishers/\n│   │   │   └── publisher.ex           # FleetPrompt.Publishers.Publisher schema (fleet.publishers)\n│   │   ├── installs/\n│   │   │   └── install.ex             # FleetPrompt.Installs.Install schema (fleet.installs)\n│   │   ├── trust/\n│   │   │   ├── engine.ex              # FleetPrompt.TrustEngine — 4-signal score computation\n│   │   │   ├── worker.ex              # FleetPrompt.TrustWorker — GenServer per agent\n│   │   │   └── supervisor.ex          # FleetPrompt.TrustSupervisor — DynamicSupervisor\n│   │   ├── registry.ex                # FleetPrompt.Registry — manifest CRUD, version management\n│   │   ├── search/\n│   │   │   ├── index.ex               # FleetPrompt.SearchIndex — pg_trgm + ts_vector management\n│   │   │   └── query.ex               # FleetPrompt.Search — search query builder\n│   │   ├── forks.ex                   # FleetPrompt.Forks — fork-and-customize workflow\n│   │   ├── install_engine.ex          # FleetPrompt.InstallEngine — deploy orchestration\n│   │   ├── audit_writer.ex            # FleetPrompt.AuditWriter — Broadway append-only audit\n│   │   ├── webhook_dispatcher.ex      # FleetPrompt.WebhookDispatcher — Oban async webhooks\n│   │   ├── pipeline_intake.ex         # FleetPrompt.PipelineIntake — dark factory event handler\n│   │   └── mcp/\n│   │       ├── server.ex              # MCP JSON-RPC server (section 11)\n│   │       └── tools.ex               # Tool definitions and handlers\n│   ├── fleet_prompt.ex                # Application entry point\n│   └── fleet_prompt_web/\n│       ├── router.ex                  # Phoenix router\n│       ├── live/\n│       │   ├── search_live.ex         # LiveView — agent search (⌘K)\n│       │   ├── agent_detail_live.ex   # LiveView — agent detail + manifest\n│       │   ├── trust_dashboard_live.ex # LiveView — trust score dashboard\n│       │   └── publisher_live.ex      # LiveView — publisher profile\n│       └── controllers/\n│           ├── api_controller.ex      # REST API for programmatic access\n│           └── webhook_controller.ex  # POST /api/pipeline/intake (CloudEvents)\n├── test/\n│   ├── trust/\n│   │   ├── engine_test.exs\n│   │   └── worker_test.exs\n│   ├── search/\n│   │   ├── index_test.exs\n│   │   └── query_test.exs\n│   ├── pipeline_intake_test.exs\n│   ├── forks_test.exs\n│   └── fixtures/\n│       ├── customer_support_manifest.json\n│       └── consolidation_event.json\n├── mix.exs\n├── Dockerfile\n└── fly.toml"},{"id":"blk-39537","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45013","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-39538","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-45014","text":"Implementation Order"}]},{"id":"blk-39539","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-45015","text":"Phase 1: Core Registry (weeks 1-6)"}]},{"id":"blk-39540","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45016","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-45017","marks":["bold"],"text":"Set up Phoenix project"},{"id":"spn-45018","text":" with Ecto, Supabase config, LiveView 2. "},{"id":"spn-45019","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement Ecto schemas"},{"id":"spn-45020","text":" (sections 3-4)"}]},{"id":"blk-39541","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39543","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45021","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Publishers.Publisher"},{"id":"spn-45022","text":" with workspace_id, user_id (Supabase Auth)"}]}],"id":"blk-39542","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39545","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45023","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Agents.Agent"},{"id":"spn-45024","text":" with workspace_id, search_vector"}]}],"id":"blk-39544","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39547","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45025","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Manifests.Manifest"},{"id":"spn-45026","text":" with all fields from section 4.1"}]}],"id":"blk-39546","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39549","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45027","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Installs.Install"},{"id":"spn-45028","text":" with workspace_id"}]}],"id":"blk-39548","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39551","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45029","text":"Audit events schema with workspace_id"}]}],"id":"blk-39550","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-39552","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45030","text":"3. "},{"id":"spn-45031","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement Registry"},{"id":"spn-45032","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-45033","marks":["code"],"text":"registry.ex"},{"id":"spn-45034","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-39553","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39555","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45035","text":"Manifest CRUD with version immutability"}]}],"id":"blk-39554","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39557","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45036","text":"Version management (semver enforcement)"}]}],"id":"blk-39556","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39559","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45037","text":"Status transitions: draft → published → deprecated → yanked"}]}],"id":"blk-39558","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-39560","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45038","text":"4. "},{"id":"spn-45039","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement ETS caches"}]},{"id":"blk-39561","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39563","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45040","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_manifests"},{"id":"spn-45041","text":" — agent_id:version → manifest map"}]}],"id":"blk-39562","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39565","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45042","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_trust_scores"},{"id":"spn-45043","text":" — agent_id → {score, computed_at}"}]}],"id":"blk-39564","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39567","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45044","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_search_index"},{"id":"spn-45045","text":" — trigram → [agent_id]"}]}],"id":"blk-39566","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39569","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45046","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_categories"},{"id":"spn-45047","text":" — category_slug → [agent_id]"}]}],"id":"blk-39568","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-39570","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-45048","text":"Phase 2: Trust Engine (weeks 4-8)"}]},{"id":"blk-39571","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45049","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-45050","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement TrustEngine"},{"id":"spn-45051","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-45052","marks":["code"],"text":"trust/engine.ex"},{"id":"spn-45053","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-39572","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39574","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45054","text":"4 weighted signals: test_coverage (30%), spec_compliance (25%), usage_history (25%), audit_quality (20%)"}]}],"id":"blk-39573","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39576","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45055","marks":["code"],"text":"compute/1"},{"id":"spn-45056","text":" → integer 0-100"}]}],"id":"blk-39575","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39578","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45057","text":"Individual signal computations from section 5.1"}]}],"id":"blk-39577","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-39579","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45058","text":"2. "},{"id":"spn-45059","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement TrustWorker"},{"id":"spn-45060","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-45061","marks":["code"],"text":"trust/worker.ex"},{"id":"spn-45062","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-39580","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39582","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45063","text":"GenServer per agent"}]}],"id":"blk-39581","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39584","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45064","text":"Computes initial score on publish"}]}],"id":"blk-39583","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39586","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45065","text":"Recomputes on new data (installs, test results, audits)"}]}],"id":"blk-39585","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39588","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45066","text":"Caches in ETS"}]}],"id":"blk-39587","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39590","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45067","text":"Broadcasts via PubSub"}]}],"id":"blk-39589","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39592","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45068","text":"Hibernates after 5 minutes inactivity"}]}],"id":"blk-39591","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-39593","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45069","text":"3. "},{"id":"spn-45070","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement TrustSupervisor"},{"id":"spn-45071","text":" — DynamicSupervisor managing TrustWorkers"}]},{"id":"blk-39594","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-45072","text":"Phase 3: Search (weeks 6-10)"}]},{"id":"blk-39595","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45073","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-45074","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement full-text search"},{"id":"spn-45075","text":" (section 8)"}]},{"id":"blk-39596","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39598","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45076","text":"ts_vector generated column on agents (name A, description B, tags C)"}]}],"id":"blk-39597","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39600","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45077","text":"pg_trgm fuzzy matching indexes"}]}],"id":"blk-39599","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39602","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45078","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Search.search/2"},{"id":"spn-45079","text":" with filters: min_trust, category, runtime, limit"}]}],"id":"blk-39601","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39604","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45080","text":"Ranking: ts_rank descending, then trust_score descending"}]}],"id":"blk-39603","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-39605","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-45081","text":"Phase 4: Publish Pipeline (weeks 8-12)"}]},{"id":"blk-39606","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45082","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-45083","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement publish flow"},{"id":"spn-45084","text":" (section 6)"}]},{"id":"blk-39607","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39609","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45085","text":"Manifest validation → spec validation → duplicate check → trust computation → index update → audit + notify"}]}],"id":"blk-39608","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39611","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45086","text":"Version immutability enforcement"}]}],"id":"blk-39610","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39613","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45087","text":"Yank support (hides from search, preserves record)"}]}],"id":"blk-39612","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-39614","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45088","text":"2. "},{"id":"spn-45089","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement AuditWriter"},{"id":"spn-45090","text":" — Broadway pipeline for batched audit writes 3. "},{"id":"spn-45091","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement WebhookDispatcher"},{"id":"spn-45092","text":" — Oban worker for async webhook delivery with retry/backoff"}]},{"id":"blk-39615","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-45093","text":"Phase 5: Install Pipeline (weeks 10-14)"}]},{"id":"blk-39616","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45094","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-45095","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement install flow"},{"id":"spn-45096","text":" (section 7)"}]},{"id":"blk-39617","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39619","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45097","text":"Permission review → Delegatic policy check → MCP dependency resolution → OpenSentience deploy → Graphonomous connect → audit + confirm"}]}],"id":"blk-39618","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-39620","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45098","text":"2. "},{"id":"spn-45099","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement InstallEngine"},{"id":"spn-45100","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-45101","marks":["code"],"text":"install_engine.ex"},{"id":"spn-45102","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-39621","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39623","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45103","text":"Permission sandboxing (section 7.2)"}]}],"id":"blk-39622","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39625","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45104","text":"Delegatic org-level denylists"}]}],"id":"blk-39624","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-39626","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45105","text":"3. "},{"id":"spn-45106","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement Fork System"},{"id":"spn-45107","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-45108","marks":["code"],"text":"forks.ex"},{"id":"spn-45109","text":") — section 9"}]},{"id":"blk-39627","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39629","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45110","text":"Fork creates new agent under forker's account"}]}],"id":"blk-39628","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39631","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45111","marks":["code"],"text":"forked_from"},{"id":"spn-45112","text":" provenance tracking"}]}],"id":"blk-39630","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39633","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45113","text":"Trust score starts at 0 for forks"}]}],"id":"blk-39632","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-39634","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-45114","text":"Phase 6: Dark Factory Pipeline Intake (weeks 12-16)"}]},{"id":"blk-39635","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45115","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-45116","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement PipelineIntake"},{"id":"spn-45117","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-45118","marks":["code"],"text":"pipeline_intake.ex"},{"id":"spn-45119","text":") — section 10.2"}]},{"id":"blk-39636","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39638","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45120","text":"Accept "},{"id":"spn-45121","marks":["code"],"text":"ConsolidationEvent"},{"id":"spn-45122","text":" from Agentelic at "},{"id":"spn-45123","marks":["code"],"text":"POST /api/pipeline/intake"}]}],"id":"blk-39637","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39640","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-45124","text":"Event validation: CloudEvents envelope, workspace_id, artifact_hash"}]}],"id":"blk-39639","kind":"list-